{"id":"n5_u04_l4","unit_id":"n5_u04","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Counting: numbers and kanji 一〜六","goal":"Read and say the numbers 0 to 10 and up to 10,000, with six kanji.","introduces":{"kanji":["k_ichi","k_ni","k_san","k_shi","k_go","k_roku"],"vocab":["v_num1","v_num2","v_num3","v_num4","v_num5","v_num6","v_nana","v_hachi","v_kyuu","v_juu","v_rei","v_sen","v_man"]},"explain":[{"heading":"The numbers","body":["いち に さん よん ご ろく なな はち きゅう じゅう. Seven is しち or なな, four is よん or し, nine is きゅう or く. 0 is れい; 100 is ひゃく, 1,000 is せん, 10,000 is まん.","The first three kanji are simply that many lines: 一 二 三. Then 四 五 六."],"examples":[{"ja":"一 二 三","reading":"ichi ni san","en":"one, two, three"},{"ja":"四 五 六","reading":"yon go roku","en":"four, five, six"}]},{"heading":"Learn by reading","body":["At this stage the kanji appear with furigana (small kana above) until you have studied them. Stroke order is not shown yet in this release."],"examples":[{"ja":"三","reading":"san","en":"three"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_nk01","q_n5u04_nk02","q_n5u04_nk03","q_n5u04_nk04","q_n5u04_nk05","q_n5u04_nk06","q_n5u04_nm01","q_n5u04_nm02","q_n5u04_nm03","q_n5u04_nm04","q_n5u04_nm05","q_n5u04_nm06","q_n5u04_nmt01","q_n5u04_nmt02","q_n5u04_nmq01","q_n5u04_nmq02","q_n5u04_nmq03","q_n5u04_nty01","q_n5u04_nty02","q_n5u04_nty03","q_n5u04_nty04","q_n5u04_nty05","q_n5u04_vm_num1","q_n5u04_vm_num2","q_n5u04_vm_num3","q_n5u04_vm_num4","q_n5u04_vm_num5","q_n5u04_vm_num6","q_n5u04_vm_nana","q_n5u04_vm_hachi","q_n5u04_vm_kyuu","q_n5u04_vm_juu","q_n5u04_vm_rei","q_n5u04_vm_sen","q_n5u04_vm_man"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_nk01","q_n5u04_nk03","q_n5u04_nk05","q_n5u04_nm02","q_n5u04_nm04","q_n5u04_nm06","q_n5u04_nmt01","q_n5u04_nmt02","q_n5u04_nty01","q_n5u04_nty03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u04_l5","unit_id":"n5_u04","instructional_level":"N5","title":"What time is it?","goal":"Tell and ask the time with じ, ふん and はん.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_ima","v_nanji","v_ichiji","v_niji","v_sanji","v_yoji","v_goji","v_rokuji","v_shichiji","v_hachiji","v_kuji","v_juuji","v_juuichiji","v_juuniji","v_gozen","v_gogo","v_han","v_gofun","v_densha","v_juppun"],"grammar":["g_clock_time"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Hours","body":["Number + じ makes an hour: いちじ, にじ, さんじ, ごじ, ろくじ, はちじ. The irregular ones are よじ (4), しちじ (7), くじ (9)."],"examples":[{"ja":"さんじ","reading":"sanji","en":"3 o'clock"},{"ja":"よじ","reading":"yoji","en":"4 o'clock"},{"ja":"くじ","reading":"kuji","en":"9 o'clock"}]},{"heading":"Minutes and the half hour","body":["はん is \"half past\". ごふん is 5 minutes; じゅっぷん is 10. Put ごぜん (a.m.) or ごご (p.m.) before the hour.","To ask: いま なんじ です か."],"examples":[{"ja":"いま ごご ろくじ はん です","reading":"ima gogo rokuji han desu","en":"It is 6:30 p.m. now."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_ti01","q_n5u04_ti02","q_n5u04_ti03","q_n5u04_ti04","q_n5u04_ti05","q_n5u04_ti06","q_n5u04_ti07","q_n5u04_ti08","q_n5u04_ti09","q_n5u04_ty01","q_n5u04_ty02","q_n5u04_ty03","q_n5u04_ty07","q_n5u04_vm_ima","q_n5u04_vm_nanji","q_n5u04_vm_gozen","q_n5u04_vm_gogo","q_n5u04_vm_han","q_n5u04_vm_gofun","q_n5u04_vm_densha","q_n5u04_vm_juppun"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_gl01","q_n5u04_gl02","q_n5u04_gl03","q_n5u04_gl04","q_n5u04_dc01","q_n5u04_dc02","q_n5u04_dc03","q_n5u04_dc04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_ti01","q_n5u04_ti02","q_n5u04_ti03","q_n5u04_ti05","q_n5u04_ti06","q_n5u04_ti07","q_n5u04_gl02","q_n5u04_dc03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u04_l6","unit_id":"n5_u04","instructional_level":"N5","title":"At the station","goal":"Ask which platform and what time the train leaves.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_kippu","v_bansen"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Platforms","body":["Number + ばんせん is a platform: さんばんせん is \"platform 3\". なんばんせん asks \"which platform?\".","A typical exchange: すみません でんしゃ は なんばんせん です か → さんばんせん です."],"examples":[{"ja":"さんばんせん","reading":"sanbansen","en":"platform 3"},{"ja":"すみません でんしゃ は なんばんせん です か","reading":"sumimasen densha wa nanbansen desu ka","en":"Excuse me, which platform is the train?"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_tr01","q_n5u04_tr02","q_n5u04_tr03","q_n5u04_tr04","q_n5u04_so01","q_n5u04_so03","q_n5u04_ty04","q_n5u04_ty05","q_n5u04_ty06","q_n5u04_dg01","q_n5u04_dg02","q_n5u04_vm_kippu","q_n5u04_vm_bansen"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_dg03","q_n5u04_dg04","q_n5u04_dg05","q_n5u04_dg06","q_n5u04_dg07","q_n5u04_tr05","q_n5u04_tr06","q_n5u04_so02"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_dg01","q_n5u04_dg03","q_n5u04_dg05","q_n5u04_dg07","q_n5u04_tr01","q_n5u04_tr02","q_n5u04_so03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u04_l7","unit_id":"n5_u04","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Listen and read","goal":"Follow platform numbers and times by ear, and read a timetable.","introduces":{},"explain":[{"heading":"Numbers by ear","body":["Platform numbers and times are announced fast. Listen for the number before ばんせん or じ."],"examples":[{"ja":"ごばんせん","reading":"gobansen","en":"platform 5"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_gl05","q_n5u04_gl06","q_n5u04_gl07","q_n5u04_gl08","q_n5u04_gl09","q_n5u04_gl10","q_n5u04_gl11","q_n5u04_gl12"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_rq01","q_n5u04_rq02","q_n5u04_rq03","q_n5u04_rq04","q_n5u04_rq05","q_n5u04_sr_ie","q_n5u04_sr_aki","q_n5u04_sr_ika","q_n5u04_sr_koko","q_n5u04_sr_kasa","q_n5u04_sr_ushi","q_n5u04_sr_shio","q_n5u04_sr_sekai","q_n5u04_sr_ikutsu","q_n5u04_sr_tako","q_n5u04_sr_tokei","q_n5u04_sr_oto"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u04_gl05","q_n5u04_gl07","q_n5u04_gl09","q_n5u04_gl11","q_n5u04_rq01","q_n5u04_rq02","q_n5u04_rq04"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
